      (match o0 with | Error e -> Error e | Ok f0 -> (match o1 with | Error e -> Error e | Ok f1 -> (match o2 with | Error e -> Error e | Ok f2 -> (match o3 with | Error e -> Error e | Ok f3 -> (match o4 with | Error e -> Error e | Ok f4 -> (match o5 with | Error e -> Error e | Ok f5 -> Ok (C__vkind__G__B__NoK3 f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5)))))))
